    "r4_5_1_compatibility": "termination_cap_pole_curvature_scale is captured but remains Modeling Worker-owned",
    "no_candidate_promotion_from_adapter": true
  },
  "boundary": "This binding makes Modeling Worker v0.13 sparse Blender-native Working Source readable by the Blender Surface System without transferring authority. The adapter may snapshot and bind Source context and may create non-authoritative diagnostic proxies. It may not redefine Source geometry, promote a candidate, or establish Class-A, ergonomic, engineering, manufacturing, physical CMF, or Release evidence."
}
